# Description
Fixes #431

### Root Cause
On the "Prepare Document" page, correspondent and document type fields displayed an asterisk `*` indicating they are automatically populated by server matching algorithms when left blank (explained by the footnote `* Value can be inferred automatically by paperless-ngx if not provided`). However, `TagsFormField` lacked a customizable label and hardcoded `S.of(context)!.tags` without the asterisk, causing inconsistency.

### Solution
- Added optional `labelText` property to `TagsFormField` defaulting to `S.of(context)!.tags`.
- Passed `labelText: "${S.of(context)!.tags} *"` in `DocumentUploadPreparationPage` to match correspondent and document type.

### Verification
- Static analysis: `fvm flutter analyze` on modified files reports 0 errors
